  CharactersPerSecond: 30
  DelayBetweenLines: 1.5
  Text:
  - That Island is completely full of garbage
  - No one cares about BOOKS
  - Everyone's filling themselves with rubbage
  - I ran away to this smaller island to get away, but these crates only used to
    have a lot of USED SHOES
  - One set even look like they belong to that HERO guy on the mech
  - I wish I had quality entertainment like a superfluous RARE CLASSICAL BOOK
  - I would even give away these USED HERO SHOES that I've been saving for later
